{"agent":"bfix-lane8","data":{"budget":"","claim":"judge() counts a still-running command gate as progress, so a contended lease with only an old gate.started event is not yield-requested while the run is live.","falsifier":"A live gate.started marker on T1 with a 5000s-old lease still yields a Verdict in judge().","item":"fix-B-long-ci-run-holds-globs-while-waiter-asks-yield","mechanism":"judge() consults the started-marker files under .ddflow/runs/<item>; a marker whose pid is alive on this host is work in flight.","probe":"Run judge(cfg,[gate.started 5000s ago],T1,lease acquired 5000s ago,waiters [T2]) with a live marker -> None; without the marker -> yield_requested.","probe_output":"live marker -> None; no marker on T2 -> Verdict(yield_requested=True)","question":"Does a live command gate run on an item stop its contended lease being judged idle?","sources":[],"verdict":"CONFIRMED"},"id":"ebbce6532d2a751743867b5ac","kind":"research.recorded","lamport":130164,"schema":1,"subject":"R8e811ed418","ts":"2026-11-02T22:14:00.093578Z"}
